WEBVTT

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:04.400
Gentle Melody

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:10.520
The rope's attached!

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:13.430
Everyone! Are you ready?

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:17.940
Here we go, Pague.

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:21.380
And everyone else too!

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.080
Yeah!

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:25.110
Ready, set...

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:32.630
Pull more strongly!

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.820
Acting so important!

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.650
Tell me about it.

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.490
Pague, just a little more. Keep trying.

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:42.380
Keep going! Keep going! A little more!

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:50.360
Just like that! Pull more!

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:52.740
Pull! More!

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:56.190
A little more...

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.560
Pague, go for it!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.290
We did it!

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:16.460
Everyone, good work!

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.710
That was easy enough.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.070
Well done, everyone.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.710
There's two more. Let's keep it up.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:28.590
Y-- yeah.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.030
C'mon, let's keep working.

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:34.710
Heave-ho!

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:40.730
Now we'll load them on one at a time.

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:41.930
Roger!

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:43.430
Here we go.

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:45.130
Ready, set...

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.760
Wait a moment.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.930
Menori! Are you trying to slack off again?

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.330
I'm not slacking off or anything.

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.140
You <i>are</i> slacking off!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:58.580
Even before, you were just giving directions.

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:01.370
Don't start thinking that directing
the work isn't work as well.

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:04.990
Nobody particularly asked you to direct us.

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:07.670
I...

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:10.910
This isn't like when we were in school!

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:12.260
Miss Student Council President.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.440
Stop arguing!

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:15.810
Yeah, Howard.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:20.400
Menori, when we're doing work that
needs direction, we'll ask you.

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:23.080
But right now everyone has to work together.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:28.780
That's right! We have an
excellent order-giver right here.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:31.460
You're just slacking off too!

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:33.490
What're you sayin'?

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.490
Don't think you're gettin'...

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:37.910
...such a cute little me...

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:39.660
..to do physical work!

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:41.340
What's so cute about you?

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:42.750
Menori...

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:51.090
Alright everyone, let's get started.

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:53.230
Hey, wait!

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:54.940
Don't just drop me!

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:57.410
You...

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:58.290
Ah well.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:04:59.530
All together...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.280
Ready, set...

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:06.940
Like that, like that...

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:08.420
Keep going...

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:14.740
Alright, right there...

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.440
Set it down there...

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:18.490
Ouch!

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:27.150
Mother!

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.580
Mother!

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:30.560
What happened, Menori?

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:33.060
It got pinched under the piano lid.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.590
Oh no! Are you okay?

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:36.770
Try to bend it.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.730
There doesn't seem to be
any problem with the bones.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.050
What a relief.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:47.660
What's wrong?

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:49.820
Ah, no, nothing.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:51.260
It's blood!

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.050
Oh no!

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:54.110
Use this.

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:55.990
Uh, I'm fine.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:00.060
Ah, yeah, yeah! At a time like this,
it's best to lick it!

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:01.630
I'm not sure about that.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:05.400
Can I take your handkerchief for a moment?

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:09.190
Can I tear a little off?

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:10.430
Sure.

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:12.340
Has the bleeding stopped?

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:14.180
Yes.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.100
Show me your finger.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.450
Bell, you're surprisingly skillful.

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:25.890
It's true.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:27.690
Now it's fine.

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:29.930
Sorry.

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.910
Bell would make a fine bride.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:34.690
Don't tease him!

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:36.680
I was joking.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:38.890
Alright, just two more.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.260
Stick with it everyone.

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:42.260
Just a lil' more and we'll be done.

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:46.610
Hey, hey! You don't plan to sit out
just because of a wound like that, do you?

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.540
Menori Visconti...

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:56.830
As a member of this Visconti family...

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:00.230
...you must always act in an
exemplary manner before everyone.

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:03.430
You must never reveal
your feelings before anyone.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:08.120
Strangle your emotions,
and always keep calm and composed.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:10.010
Do you understand?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:15.580
Mother!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:16.460
Menori!

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:17.640
Mother!

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:21.230
Mother! Mother!

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:22.330
Be silent!

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:30.340
Now dry your eyes.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.010
Hey, hurry up and help us!

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:41.290
Stop it, Howard!

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:44.700
It's okay. Take a little break, Menori.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.140
What are you doing?

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.230
Yeesh! Just shut up!

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:50.930
Why does she always get special treatment?

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:52.540
Please let it go!

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:57.340
Just like that. Go for it, Pague!

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.060
Hey, Menori...

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:13.910
You played the violin a little while ago, didn't you?

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:15.000
Yes.

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:17.040
You're very skilled.

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:19.710
Yeah, yeah! I only heard a little...

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.360
...but it was very good.

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:23.760
Menori?

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:25.740
None of you...

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.840
None of you understand.

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:44.760
Alright, slowly, slowly...

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:49.240
A little more, a little more...

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.240
Stop!

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.240
Luna, stop!

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:55.990
Roger!

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:59.420
Stop! Pague, stop!

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.590
Alright, it's good over here.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.000
It's okay here too.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.560
Alright! Now for the next one!

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:09.990
Ready!

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:13.050
It'll be over after a little more.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:15.690
Luna...

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:18.750
I'll go find some food.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:21.240
In that case, Kaoru or Bell should go...

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:21.880
No.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.030
Everyone has a job they should be doing.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:26.980
I'll be fine on my own.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:28.050
But...

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.300
Everyone takes care of themselves.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:31.090
...right?

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.470
A bird's nest.

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:29.440
Maybe there are eggs.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:37.200
Ouch!

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:57.380
Is it ready yet?

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.870
No, it needs to cook a little longer.

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:05.270
Today's dinner is just one fish?

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:08.440
But we have to thankful that we have food at all.

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:09.750
That's right.

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:12.600
And we also have to be thankful for Kaoru's skills.

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:15.300
Kaoru.

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:18.410
Can you teach me how to make fish hooks tomorrow?

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:19.690
Me too!

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:20.610
Sure.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:24.840
I caught one too! You should thank me!

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:27.260
Howard, the fish you caught...

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:28.780
...is this.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:29.830
It's cute!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:31.140
Shut up!

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.010
I was completely exhausted from the hard labour.

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.260
And I still went fishing!

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:39.170
As opposed to a certain someone
who came back empty-handed.

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:41.310
Howard, stop that!

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.910
If it's too frustrating, you just
have to bring some food back.

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:49.130
Right now she's a useless person
who can only give directions.

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:51.860
As usual, only your mouth is skillful.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.330
What did you say?

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.580
That's right.

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:58.670
If you have enough energy to complain like that,
I guess you'll be working hard again tomorrow!

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:00.410
You're too easy on her!

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:02.850
Those who work not should eat not!

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:06.240
Those who don't bring back food
should get less food to eat!

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:08.040
Don't be ridiculous!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.480
Anyone can have an off day!

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:13.050
That doesn't bother me.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:19.440
Howard! This is because you said weird stuff!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.310
That's right!

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.500
You said too much by anyone's count!

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:24.000
Like I care!

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:25.710
Apologize!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:26.780
No way!

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:30.560
More importantly, I'm taking her share.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:31.350
Never!

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:33.830
Your share is just this!

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:35.230
Why?

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:37.260
Because you're always taking breaks!

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:38.980
That has nothing to do with it!

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.370
I said no, so no.

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:41.870
Why do you get to decide?

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:02.610
It hurts.

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:07.930
Then I'll cast a spell
to make the pain fly away.

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.110
How is it?

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:15.840
The pain flew away.

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:17.440
That's good to hear.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:22.350
The fingers are very important for a violinist.

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:25.260
Try to be careful not to hurt them from now on.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:26.210
Okay.

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:27.110
Good girl.

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.630
Whatever it is, you try your hardest.

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:36.490
Menori, Mommy loves the sound you
make when you play the violin.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:40.540
It carries your gentle feelings with it.

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:42.150
Mother...

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:01.540
Only the violin sustained me.

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:05.190
Before my father, the strict
commonwealth parliament member...

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:09.280
...only when I was playing
could I become my true self.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:52.820
Menori...

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:02.250
It's a nice timbre.

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:07.160
Sorry.

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:10.430
I've been listening in for a while.

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:13.220
If you want to listen, you can.

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:16.350
It was a heartwarming sound.

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:22.710
It felt somehow like it would
make me a more kind-hearted person.

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:25.280
Sorry. I spoke out of line.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:27.980
Did you have some business with me?

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:30.510
Not business per se...

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:31.800
Then what?

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.810
Menori, I had something I wanted to tell you.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.370
You see...

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:40.260
The reason we've made it this far
is because you've been here for us.

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:42.260
If you hadn't been here...

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:46.440
...we wouldn't be able to live here like we are.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:49.410
But...

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:52.290
...it'd be okay if you opened yourself up to us more.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.180
...if you became more free...

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:56.780
Free?

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:01.890
I think it'd be better if you let your honest
self out instead of always relying on your violin.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:03.060
What?

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:07.800
I'm going.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:20.270
Whatever it is, you try your hardest.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:25.370
Menori, Mommy loves the sound you
make when you play the violin.

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:29.760
You must never reveal your
feelings before anyone.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:35.190
I think it'd be better if you let your honest
self out instead of always relying on your violin.

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:44.570
That Luna...

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:54.710
Ready?

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:55.910
Is it okay?

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:57.710
Yeah.

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.060
Don't whine!

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:53.290
Whining and seeking sympathy from others
are the most shameful conduct.

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:14.080
When you speak to friends,
you must not let your heart reveal itself recklessly.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:17.360
Allowing weakness to escape to your
opponent is the conduct of a fool.

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:25.760
You must not appear impure before common people.

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.310
They often choose the wrong path.

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:36.320
To guide them to the correct path, you must be seen as a calm figure standing two steps behind.

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:54.340
Whatever it is, you try your hardest.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:37.180
Father...

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:41.160
Mother...

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:56.210
Damn, it's like there's no fish at all.

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:02.510
Well, we'll go find some fruit.

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:08.780
We're countin' on you.
My fuel cell likes the sugariest fruit best!

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:10.560
We'll do our best.

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:17.910
Menori, welcome back.

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:24.000
What?

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:27.840
They're eggs!

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.110
It's true! There's lots of them!

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.100
Hey! Everyone!

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:34.760
Menori brought back some eggs!

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:36.470
Really?

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:43.330
Alright! Today we get to eat eggs!

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:49.330
And with my deluxe frying pan,
we can make 'em sunny side up!

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:52.240
The sunny side up eggs I've dreamed of!

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:55.410
It's only eggs, so what are you
making such a big deal about?

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:58.260
Then I guess I can take Howard's share.

00:21:58.260 --> 00:21:59.330
As if, who said you could?

00:21:59.330 --> 00:21:59.930
Way to go. Everyone's delighted.

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:01.090
Howard, you said you didn't want yours.

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:02.350
I never said that!

00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:04.690
Just what have you been doing?

00:22:06.710 --> 00:22:09.190
I found bird nests on the cliff by the coast.

00:22:09.770 --> 00:22:10.890
That finger!

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:13.220
It's nothing major.

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:15.640
But what about the violin?

00:22:16.110 --> 00:22:16.670
Luna...

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:20.910
I don't think the way I've acted
until now wasn't really me.

00:22:21.620 --> 00:22:24.410
But I've managed to become a little more honest.

00:22:25.610 --> 00:22:26.310
Thank you.

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:27.450
Menori...

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:32.790
Menori...

00:22:34.390 --> 00:22:35.630
Thank you.

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:46.560
So, let's all go all out for today's wonderful dinner!

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:49.590
I'll do my best at fishing!

00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:53.210
I can't let myself lose to Menori, after all.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:55.030
Oh, Howard.

00:22:56.740 --> 00:22:58.220
What's so funny?

00:23:03.560 --> 00:23:05.680
House-building is progressing nicely.

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:07.860
It's 'cuz everyone's tryin' so hard!

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:11.960
Howard's making Bell do stuff for him again!

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:14.460
He never changes.

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:17.230
Howard's 'my pace' style is troublesome, too.

00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:22.430
Bell, get with it! It's okay if you give
Howard a thump on the head!

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:24.340
Go for it, Bell!

00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:27.960
Next time: Everyone's House
